   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Paul,<div><br></div><div>I think I may have discovered a problem that can arise when specifying `by` variables in the grouping term. The short version is that it looks like when the identifying values contain periods, the levels get mixed up in estimation. Below is a reproducible example illustrating the issue:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#Data frame containing the &quot;person-level&quot; data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  condition </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Treatment&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Control&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> each</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  grp_mean </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#specify that the standard deviations vary by group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df_sd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Treatment&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Treatment&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Control&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Control&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;A&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;B&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    grp_sd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  left_join</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df_sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grp_cond </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;_&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">person_mean </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grp_mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grp_sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID_2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.V1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.V2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.V3&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#create another identifier with periods</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID_2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ID_2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df<br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># each person has 5 observations</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#generate y values</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> person_mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat<br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#two models fit on the same data. Only difference is the format of the grouping variable (ID vs ID_2)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>m_test </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">test</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>m_test2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID_2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">test</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br><br><br>truncated</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#m_test</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Level</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Effects</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Number</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of levels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                     </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Estimate</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Est</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CI u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CI </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Eff</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sample</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rhat</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Intercept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">groupA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.50</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.43</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.60</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#066\">835</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.01</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Intercept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">groupB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.18</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.16</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.91</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.53</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#066\">330</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.01</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">......</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#m_test2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Level</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Effects</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ID_2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Number</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of levels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                     </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Estimate</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Est</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CI u</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CI </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Eff</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sample</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rhat</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Intercept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">groupA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.68</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.13</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.46</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#066\">219</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.02</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Intercept</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">groupB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.49</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.28</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.74</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#066\">312</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.01</span></div></code></div><div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>If I&#39;m wrong, I would appreciate understanding the reason for this difference.</div><div><br></div></div></div>"
